magpie — https://github.com/yetone/magpie
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The API endpoint gateway's failure classification, cooldowns, and conversation
stickiness are ported to TypeScript from magpie's internal/gateway
(routing.go, fallback.go, affinity.go, gateway.go, prompt.go):

  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/failure.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/cooldown.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/affinity.ts

The gateway's protocol translation (the shared intermediate format, Anthropic
Messages, OpenAI Chat, OpenAI Responses, tool-pairing repair, SSE reading) is
ported from
magpie's internal/gateway (ir.go, anthropic.go, chat.go, responses.go, sse.go,
gateway.go), and its tests reuse cases from magpie's
anthropic_tool_pairing_test.go, chat_tool_pairing_test.go,
pair_tool_items_test.go, orphan_tool_output_test.go, translate_stream_test.go,
devin_tool_ids_test.go, anthropic_cache_ttl_test.go, stop_context_test.go,
minimax_think_test.go, format_test.go, reasoning_replay_test.go,
deepseek_anthropic_thinking_test.go, anthropic_image_source_test.go,
attachments_test.go, upstream_bytes_test.go, namespace_test.go,
codex_custom_tools_test.go, agent_message_test.go, codex_developer_cache_test.go,
tool_strict_test.go, responses_file_id_test.go, responses_cache_write_test.go,
reasoning_state_responses_test.go, reasoning_passthrough_test.go and
deepseek_step_lead_test.go. The pass-through request's thinking fixes for other
vendors' models (thinkingOffUnlessAsked, withThinkingOnToolTurns in
anthropic.go, withReasoningText in responses.go) are ported into passthrough.ts:

  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/ir.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/anthropic.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/chat.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/responses.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/sse.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/passthrough.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/passthrough.test.ts
  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/translation/*.test.ts

The request-format choice (chooseRequestFormat) follows magpie's usable and
MessagesFirst (internal/gateway/gateway.go, internal/provider/provider.go):

  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/gateway/routing.ts

Request-format auto-detection (each format's base URL, the model asked, the
smallest request) follows magpie's internal/provider/detect.go and test.go:

  packages/server/src/server/api-endpoints/upstream-detect.ts

